(6209595, 917027, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I think I would like it even more if the ghostly figure was against the plain brick wall, but his placement in the composition is necessary, so wouldn''t have worked, and I suspect that removing the sign from the wall might have been a step too far.</td>', 'I like this.  I think I would like it even more if the ghostly figure was against the plain brick wall, but his placement in the composition is necessary, so wouldn''t have worked, and I suspect that removing the sign from the wall might have been a step too far.', '2010-11-03 01:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6209599, 917520, 67258, '<td valign="top">Looks like a few people are still awake, or have just woken up, as there are some lights on.   The lights work in your favour as they add some visual points of interest.  Makes me long for a holiday on the Mediterranean!</td>', 'Looks like a few people are still awake, or have just woken up, as there are some lights on.   The lights work in your favour as they add some visual points of interest.  Makes me long for a holiday on the Mediterranean!', '2010-11-03 01:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
