(6209630, 917889, 67258, '<td valign="top">An interesting cloudscape, but the lone tree just doesn''t hold enough interest for me.  Might have been better if it was framed so that the tree was exactly on the left third, or even quarter, and that way you would have lost the bit that is just coming in to frame.</td>', 'An interesting cloudscape, but the lone tree just doesn''t hold enough interest for me.  Might have been better if it was framed so that the tree was exactly on the left third, or even quarter, and that way you would have lost the bit that is just coming in to frame.', '2010-11-03 02:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
