(6211840, 916625, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. Trails are a really nice, sharp, short length. Rest of the scene is perfect. Great exposure, great tones. Excellent photo.</td>', 'This is wonderful. Trails are a really nice, sharp, short length. Rest of the scene is perfect. Great exposure, great tones. Excellent photo.', '2010-11-04 16:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211849, 917070, 108069, '<td valign="top">A technically perfect shot and creative arrangement. Lovely colors and a "How did they do that?" element as well. Will be interesting to see how it resonates with voters. Only critique I can make is that your choice of backdrop, be it paper or whatever, has a pattern to it that gives the impression on very first glance that the image is noisy. Of course it isn''t, but you may want to think about that for your next setup.</td>', 'A technically perfect shot and creative arrangement. Lovely colors and a "How did they do that?" element as well. Will be interesting to see how it resonates with voters. Only critique I can make is that your choice of backdrop, be it paper or whatever, has a pattern to it that gives the impression on very first glance that the image is noisy. Of course it isn''t, but you may want to think about that for your next setup.', '2010-11-04 16:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211851, 917722, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of stars. And something''s on fire, but not sure what. Has a cool something''s about to hit earth feel to it, but needs a bit more I think. Not voting, just making lame comments.</td>', 'Nice shot of stars. And something''s on fire, but not sure what. Has a cool something''s about to hit earth feel to it, but needs a bit more I think. Not voting, just making lame comments.', '2010-11-04 16:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211852, 916798, 104230, '<td valign="top">This has a lovely early morning softness to it.  However, for my taste, the border is too harsh against that softness and my eye keeps getting drawn away from the image to the lower border especially...</td>', 'This has a lovely early morning softness to it.  However, for my taste, the border is too harsh against that softness and my eye keeps getting drawn away from the image to the lower border especially...', '2010-11-04 16:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211855, 917758, 108069, '<td valign="top">Quality shot of the moon. I''m sure you''re getting grief over the noise, but in a weird way I like how it adds texture to what would be an otherwise blank, black field for the rest of the photo. The detail in the moon itself is stellar. Pun kind of intended.</td>', 'Quality shot of the moon. I''m sure you''re getting grief over the noise, but in a weird way I like how it adds texture to what would be an otherwise blank, black field for the rest of the photo. The detail in the moon itself is stellar. Pun kind of intended.', '2010-11-04 16:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211862, 917866, 108069, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition. I like how the palms frame the right side. Nice star flares off the lights. Even the swinging liter free zone sign tells a bit more of the story that you''re really beachside. Nice lines. Well done.</td>', 'Really nice composition. I like how the palms frame the right side. Nice star flares off the lights. Even the swinging liter free zone sign tells a bit more of the story that you''re really beachside. Nice lines. Well done.', '2010-11-04 16:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211990, 917866, 104230, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. I like the use of black and white, it helps emphasize the form/structure of the building and the bike is a great addition (I assume)</td>', 'Great perspective. I like the use of black and white, it helps emphasize the form/structure of the building and the bike is a great addition (I assume)', '2010-11-04 17:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212073, 916653, 108069, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot. Hell of a magnification you''ve got there. Excellent exposure. Great detail. No noise. I don''t see any man, but maybe he''s on the dark side. Very well done.</td>', 'Amazing shot. Hell of a magnification you''ve got there. Excellent exposure. Great detail. No noise. I don''t see any man, but maybe he''s on the dark side. Very well done.', '2010-11-04 18:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212087, 917887, 108069, '<td valign="top">Dark and mysterious but with a random rainbow in a black and white scene. Like film has been in a hot car. Pretty cool.</td>', 'Dark and mysterious but with a random rainbow in a black and white scene. Like film has been in a hot car. Pretty cool.', '2010-11-04 18:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
