(6212097, 917861, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. Yes the wall''s blown out, but there are some necessary evils. Nice detail in the stonework. Cool scene. Very nice entry.</td>', 'Wonderful composition. Yes the wall''s blown out, but there are some necessary evils. Nice detail in the stonework. Cool scene. Very nice entry.', '2010-11-04 19:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
