(6212121, 917751, 108069, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot, and it should be at or near the top. Nothing much to say other than perfectly exposed, very creative eye and composition, and sharp. Seems like it should rotate, which would blur it, but no. I also like how you aligned the column with the edge of the frame. Attention to detail, but there was a choice to make and I think you chose wisely. Excellent work.</td>', 'Fabulous shot, and it should be at or near the top. Nothing much to say other than perfectly exposed, very creative eye and composition, and sharp. Seems like it should rotate, which would blur it, but no. I also like how you aligned the column with the edge of the frame. Attention to detail, but there was a choice to make and I think you chose wisely. Excellent work.', '2010-11-04 19:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
