(6213047, 917815, 30861, '<td valign="top">This has got to be Sara''s, she being from York and all, and she having reported a huge number of comments and faves, and this being, really, the only image in the challenge that might get that kind of attention, and Deniz Best Kebabs being a York institution and all...<br/> <br/>So congrats, Sara :-) I love this image, it was on the top of my heap from the moment I saw it, though there is another, quirkier image sharing podium space with it right now :-)</td>', 'This has got to be Sara''s, she being from York and all, and she having reported a huge number of comments and faves, and this being, really, the only image in the challenge that might get that kind of attention, and Deniz Best Kebabs being a York institution and all... So congrats, Sara :-) I love this image, it was on the top of my heap from the moment I saw it, though there is another, quirkier image sharing podium space with it right now :-)', '2010-11-05 15:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213054, 917751, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is just absolutely stunning.  A photo that made me gasp when it opened on my screen.  I have seen photos of this in the daylight, but they are nothing compared to this.  One of the few examples in the challenge of a photo that is the better for being taken in the dead of night.<br/> <br/>Back for another view - definitely my favourite of the challenge - fingers crossed it gets the Blue.</td>', 'This is just absolutely stunning.  A photo that made me gasp when it opened on my screen.  I have seen photos of this in the daylight, but they are nothing compared to this.  One of the few examples in the challenge of a photo that is the better for being taken in the dead of night. Back for another view - definitely my favourite of the challenge - fingers crossed it gets the Blue.', '2010-11-05 15:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213055, 916843, 67258, '<td valign="top">And only the photographers are mad enough to be up at this time!  I take it this is an HDR?  Beautifully balanced exposure.<br/>Back for another view, and a bump to 9. In mytop 3 of the challenge.</td>', 'And only the photographers are mad enough to be up at this time!  I take it this is an HDR?  Beautifully balanced exposure.Back for another view, and a bump to 9. In mytop 3 of the challenge.', '2010-11-05 15:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213057, 916798, 67258, '<td valign="top">This does, indeed look very peaceful.  At first I wasn''t keen on the motion blur as the boats bob on the water, but on reflection, I think that it adds to the ambiance.  Border suits the image, and again, adds to the feeling you were going for, as does the split-tone colouring.</td>', 'This does, indeed look very peaceful.  At first I wasn''t keen on the motion blur as the boats bob on the water, but on reflection, I think that it adds to the ambiance.  Border suits the image, and again, adds to the feeling you were going for, as does the split-tone colouring.', '2010-11-05 15:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213058, 917222, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool photo - and I envy your early morning light, it''s pitch dark in England at this time of the year!  An absolutely super photo that speaks of the african plains.</td>', 'This is such a cool photo - and I envy your early morning light, it''s pitch dark in England at this time of the year!  An absolutely super photo that speaks of the african plains.', '2010-11-05 15:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213060, 916881, 67258, '<td valign="top">This works well for me.  The blur adds to the sense of time - almost as though I am looking at the scene through sleep fogged eyes. Quite strange - you have captured a feeling of movement,speed, quietness, and stillness all in the same image.</td>', 'This works well for me.  The blur adds to the sense of time - almost as though I am looking at the scene through sleep fogged eyes. Quite strange - you have captured a feeling of movement,speed, quietness, and stillness all in the same image.', '2010-11-05 15:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213064, 917686, 67258, '<td valign="top">Now that is cute!</td>', 'Now that is cute!', '2010-11-05 15:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213066, 917866, 67258, '<td valign="top">Love the long view up the empty, deserted street, and the shadow of the bicycle.  Certainly makes me feel dead of night.</td>', 'Love the long view up the empty, deserted street, and the shadow of the bicycle.  Certainly makes me feel dead of night.', '2010-11-05 15:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213070, 917753, 68020, '<td valign="top">WOW! - 9</td>', 'WOW! - 9', '2010-11-05 15:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213071, 917115, 67258, '<td valign="top">And 6 minutes to spare! I am glad you included the bakery workers in the frame as they help provide a bit of a sense of story.  I would probably have given another point or two if they were more prominent.</td>', 'And 6 minutes to spare! I am glad you included the bakery workers in the frame as they help provide a bit of a sense of story.  I would probably have given another point or two if they were more prominent.', '2010-11-05 15:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213074, 917729, 67258, '<td valign="top">Now this is lovely, and I can''t imagine a more pleasing photo being taken in daylight.  Calm, peaceful, quiet, understated.<br/> <br/>Back for another view, and a bump to 9.  In my top 3 of the challenge.</td>', 'Now this is lovely, and I can''t imagine a more pleasing photo being taken in daylight.  Calm, peaceful, quiet, understated. Back for another view, and a bump to 9.  In my top 3 of the challenge.', '2010-11-05 15:19:49.000000', NULL, 1);
