(6215456, 916798, 119419, '<td valign="top">lovely and soft</td>', 'lovely and soft', '2010-11-07 20:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215462, 917582, 119419, '<td valign="top">quite sureal in a fashion, like it though for the colours</td>', 'quite sureal in a fashion, like it though for the colours', '2010-11-07 20:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215521, 917815, 54446, '<td valign="top">I really like this scene.  Wonderful lighting and interesting people.  My fav in this challenge.</td>', 'I really like this scene.  Wonderful lighting and interesting people.  My fav in this challenge.', '2010-11-07 21:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215590, 917882, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excuse me, but perhaps Ghostbusters ought to have a look at your sink. I think the tilt to the photo add a good deal to its interest.</td>', 'Excuse me, but perhaps Ghostbusters ought to have a look at your sink. I think the tilt to the photo add a good deal to its interest.', '2010-11-07 22:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215592, 917722, 77196, '<td valign="top">Maybe it is my screen, but this is almost totally black, and I can''t make out what the colored dots are in the pool of light. On closer look, it seems to have stars in it. I like stars.</td>', 'Maybe it is my screen, but this is almost totally black, and I can''t make out what the colored dots are in the pool of light. On closer look, it seems to have stars in it. I like stars.', '2010-11-07 22:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215593, 917783, 77196, '<td valign="top">Quite nice for a long exposure and such drastic differences in lighting.</td>', 'Quite nice for a long exposure and such drastic differences in lighting.', '2010-11-07 22:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215594, 917802, 77196, '<td valign="top">Now that''s what I call a border! Am not sure how you captured the two alien vessles (top of window frame and on window).</td>', 'Now that''s what I call a border! Am not sure how you captured the two alien vessles (top of window frame and on window).', '2010-11-07 22:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215595, 917751, 77196, '<td valign="top">Definitely a cool shot - I like the monochrome approach, and the words displayed on the building and courtyard.</td>', 'Definitely a cool shot - I like the monochrome approach, and the words displayed on the building and courtyard.', '2010-11-07 22:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215596, 917070, 77196, '<td valign="top">I do hope you had this set up before you went to bed. A quite nice glasses shot with a twist.</td>', 'I do hope you had this set up before you went to bed. A quite nice glasses shot with a twist.', '2010-11-07 22:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215597, 916653, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice moon image. I had no idea how hard this was to do well, until I tried it...</td>', 'Very nice moon image. I had no idea how hard this was to do well, until I tried it...', '2010-11-07 22:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215598, 917875, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I especially like the reflection in the side of the ramp.</td>', 'Nicely done. I especially like the reflection in the side of the ramp.', '2010-11-07 22:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215599, 917889, 77196, '<td valign="top">At 5 AM? I like the interesting pattern to the clouds, and the silhouetted tree &amp; hill tops.</td>', 'At 5 AM? I like the interesting pattern to the clouds, and the silhouetted tree & hill tops.', '2010-11-07 22:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215600, 916809, 77196, '<td valign="top">Looks like the corner post of a bed. Not sure there''s enough here to strongly like or dislike the shot. I do like the spot of light and blue with rays through it.</td>', 'Looks like the corner post of a bed. Not sure there''s enough here to strongly like or dislike the shot. I do like the spot of light and blue with rays through it.', '2010-11-07 22:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215601, 916831, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely done. She looks so tired, but not a bit sleepy.</td>', 'This is very nicely done. She looks so tired, but not a bit sleepy.', '2010-11-07 22:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215603, 917629, 77196, '<td valign="top">That''s what I call a deserted street. This is nicely done. Monochrome was a good choice. In just about every downtown-ish area, you always have to fight with traffic lights and street lights. I like the trash bin serving as the right side anchor, and how it helps lead your eye into the picture.</td>', 'That''s what I call a deserted street. This is nicely done. Monochrome was a good choice. In just about every downtown-ish area, you always have to fight with traffic lights and street lights. I like the trash bin serving as the right side anchor, and how it helps lead your eye into the picture.', '2010-11-07 22:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215604, 917781, 77196, '<td valign="top">Yes, that universal drug that keeps the world going - caffeine! Not sure why one would have their rings and watch on at 4 AM, but to each their own...</td>', 'Yes, that universal drug that keeps the world going - caffeine! Not sure why one would have their rings and watch on at 4 AM, but to each their own...', '2010-11-07 22:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215606, 916625, 77196, '<td valign="top">This conveys a sense of majesty, grandeur, and quietness. Very nicely done.</td>', 'This conveys a sense of majesty, grandeur, and quietness. Very nicely done.', '2010-11-07 22:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215607, 917729, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wow! Combination of night sky, passing clouds, and interesting lighting. Very nicely done!</td>', 'Wow! Combination of night sky, passing clouds, and interesting lighting. Very nicely done!', '2010-11-07 22:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215610, 917861, 77196, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too different, and the harsh light blows out part of the building. Yet, you''ve captured nice detail in the window shutter and stone on the left side of the window.</td>', 'Lighting is too different, and the harsh light blows out part of the building. Yet, you''ve captured nice detail in the window shutter and stone on the left side of the window.', '2010-11-07 22:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215612, 917758, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice moon shot.</td>', 'Nice moon shot.', '2010-11-07 22:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215614, 917798, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting swoosh on upper ramp. I like how you''ve captured detail in the darker foreground without bowing out the strongly lit background.</td>', 'Interesting swoosh on upper ramp. I like how you''ve captured detail in the darker foreground without bowing out the strongly lit background.', '2010-11-07 22:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215615, 917341, 77196, '<td valign="top">I hope she didn''t use her pillow on you. Nice, even lighting and great pp. The shot made me laugh.</td>', 'I hope she didn''t use her pillow on you. Nice, even lighting and great pp. The shot made me laugh.', '2010-11-07 22:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215616, 917730, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the hand railing they have on that staircase. Hope anyone using it at 4:32 AM is wide awake - that last step could be a duesy! I like the lighting and texture on this shot.</td>', 'Love the hand railing they have on that staircase. Hope anyone using it at 4:32 AM is wide awake - that last step could be a duesy! I like the lighting and texture on this shot.', '2010-11-07 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215617, 917576, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of hue. The blown-out area on his nose and beside his eye really stand out with the hue choice. However, it does convey an other-worldliness that one feels at this hour of the morning...</td>', 'Interesting use of hue. The blown-out area on his nose and beside his eye really stand out with the hue choice. However, it does convey an other-worldliness that one feels at this hour of the morning...', '2010-11-07 22:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215619, 917866, 77196, '<td valign="top">Man, that''s either your bike or a low crime area - looks far to nice to be sitting all alone in the middle of the night unattended. I like the lighting on this, and the look of the windows of the shop.</td>', 'Man, that''s either your bike or a low crime area - looks far to nice to be sitting all alone in the middle of the night unattended. I like the lighting on this, and the look of the windows of the shop.', '2010-11-07 22:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215620, 917735, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure how technically good this shot is, but it makes me smile (as long as I don''t have to tend to the changing and feeding, that is). I love the blurred arms.</td>', 'Not sure how technically good this shot is, but it makes me smile (as long as I don''t have to tend to the changing and feeding, that is). I love the blurred arms.', '2010-11-07 22:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215623, 916843, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very, very nicely done. There was actually another photographer up at that hour, or are you playing games with us? This is spot on - exactly the correct exposure. I love the reflected lights on the water, and the crispness of the NY skyline.</td>', 'Very, very nicely done. There was actually another photographer up at that hour, or are you playing games with us? This is spot on - exactly the correct exposure. I love the reflected lights on the water, and the crispness of the NY skyline.', '2010-11-07 22:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215625, 917863, 77196, '<td valign="top">So that''s what goes bump in the night! This is nicely done and nice lighting.</td>', 'So that''s what goes bump in the night! This is nicely done and nice lighting.', '2010-11-07 22:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215626, 917884, 77196, '<td valign="top">Quite nice star shot. You must be in an area with low light pollution - lots of dim stars in the shot.</td>', 'Quite nice star shot. You must be in an area with low light pollution - lots of dim stars in the shot.', '2010-11-07 22:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215627, 917520, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Seems like lots of lights on for this hour of the morning, but your exposure is very nice - enough light to show the color and texture of the roof without looking blown out anywhere.</td>', 'Nice shot. Seems like lots of lights on for this hour of the morning, but your exposure is very nice - enough light to show the color and texture of the roof without looking blown out anywhere.', '2010-11-07 22:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215628, 917333, 77196, '<td valign="top">You''re braver than I  - not sure I''d be comfortable here at this hour of the day. I like your use of color - for some reason it adds to the sense of aloneness and reality.</td>', 'You''re braver than I  - not sure I''d be comfortable here at this hour of the day. I like your use of color - for some reason it adds to the sense of aloneness and reality.', '2010-11-07 22:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215629, 917815, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. Nice image.</td>', 'Great lighting. Nice image.', '2010-11-07 22:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215633, 917812, 77196, '<td valign="top">Normally, I''d complain about this being OOF, grainy, etc. In this challenge, I think these add to the feel of the shot. That light in the center is a bit overblown - not sure if there was anything you could hide it behind and still get your shot...</td>', 'Normally, I''d complain about this being OOF, grainy, etc. In this challenge, I think these add to the feel of the shot. That light in the center is a bit overblown - not sure if there was anything you could hide it behind and still get your shot...', '2010-11-07 23:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215636, 917862, 77196, '<td valign="top">Good lighting on this. IMO, it is unfortunate that the side of the birdhouse lined up with the gap between the fence pickets. The edge blends too much, IMO, making the bird house difficult to distinguish in the reduced lighting.</td>', 'Good lighting on this. IMO, it is unfortunate that the side of the birdhouse lined up with the gap between the fence pickets. The edge blends too much, IMO, making the bird house difficult to distinguish in the reduced lighting.', '2010-11-07 23:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215637, 917582, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of color in an otherwise bland shot. I especially like the "halo" around the moon.</td>', 'Interesting use of color in an otherwise bland shot. I especially like the "halo" around the moon.', '2010-11-07 23:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215638, 917887, 77196, '<td valign="top">Which I think my eyes are beginning to do - not enough here to figure out what I''m looking at. Also not sure about the reddish band across the shot.</td>', 'Which I think my eyes are beginning to do - not enough here to figure out what I''m looking at. Also not sure about the reddish band across the shot.', '2010-11-07 23:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215639, 917222, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of motion blur.</td>', 'Interesting use of motion blur.', '2010-11-07 23:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215640, 917115, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice. Makes me hungry. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice. Makes me hungry. Nice lighting.', '2010-11-07 23:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215642, 916881, 77196, '<td valign="top">Better them than me. I like the almost everything blurry look with a few exceptions. It correctly conveys the "hazy" feel about early morning.</td>', 'Better them than me. I like the almost everything blurry look with a few exceptions. It correctly conveys the "hazy" feel about early morning.', '2010-11-07 23:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215643, 916798, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the reflected lights on the water, and the boats in the foreground.</td>', 'I like the reflected lights on the water, and the boats in the foreground.', '2010-11-07 23:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215644, 917871, 77196, '<td valign="top">That''s scary. I like the feel of closing-in due to the perspective.</td>', 'That''s scary. I like the feel of closing-in due to the perspective.', '2010-11-07 23:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215645, 917753, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and reflection.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and reflection.', '2010-11-07 23:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215646, 917686, 77196, '<td valign="top">How nice!</td>', 'How nice!', '2010-11-07 23:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215647, 917027, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Definitely looks like it belongs in the Twilight Zone, or Dr. Who.</td>', 'Nicely done. Definitely looks like it belongs in the Twilight Zone, or Dr. Who.', '2010-11-07 23:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215648, 917803, 77196, '<td valign="top">So that''s how you get them out of bed at that hour! Interesting through the window shot / reflection.</td>', 'So that''s how you get them out of bed at that hour! Interesting through the window shot / reflection.', '2010-11-07 23:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
