(6216678, 917629, 108069, '<td valign="top">Definitely gets across the lonely/desolate feeling very well. A bit grainy, but it doesn''t bother me. Nice perspective. Good job.</td>', 'Definitely gets across the lonely/desolate feeling very well. A bit grainy, but it doesn''t bother me. Nice perspective. Good job.', '2010-11-08 15:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
