(6216683, 917815, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great processing for this particular photo. Has a classic painting look to it. The three were certainly up to the task of modeling in the proper tone for the theme. Very cool shot.</td>', 'Great processing for this particular photo. Has a classic painting look to it. The three were certainly up to the task of modeling in the proper tone for the theme. Very cool shot.', '2010-11-08 15:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6216686, 917729, 108069, '<td valign="top">Tremendous colors captured here, where it would seem impossible to get this much info at this time of night/morning. Obviously a long capture (due to the boat''s movement) yet the grass has remained sharp and the stars are bright and sharp as well. The flow of the clouds and the grass seem to frame the trees and stars and the composition is just excellent. I''d love to steal a trick or two on how you got the stars to pop so sharply with such great color like that. Outstanding.</td>', 'Tremendous colors captured here, where it would seem impossible to get this much info at this time of night/morning. Obviously a long capture (due to the boat''s movement) yet the grass has remained sharp and the stars are bright and sharp as well. The flow of the clouds and the grass seem to frame the trees and stars and the composition is just excellent. I''d love to steal a trick or two on how you got the stars to pop so sharply with such great color like that. Outstanding.', '2010-11-08 15:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6216895, 917753, 59796, '<td valign="top">My pick for blue in this challenge. As calm and peaceful as a downtown could ever get. Beautiful tone to it.</td>', 'My pick for blue in this challenge. As calm and peaceful as a downtown could ever get. Beautiful tone to it.', '2010-11-08 17:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6216898, 917751, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very unusual lighting, wonderfully captured. I see that the camera is in the small vertical breakline so it doesn''t get flare :) Hope this ribbons.</td>', 'Very unusual lighting, wonderfully captured. I see that the camera is in the small vertical breakline so it doesn''t get flare :) Hope this ribbons.', '2010-11-08 18:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6216901, 917686, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! I absolutely don''t know how to capture the human element, so a bit jealous when I see such warm pictures. Hope this ribbons.</td>', 'Nicely done! I absolutely don''t know how to capture the human element, so a bit jealous when I see such warm pictures. Hope this ribbons.', '2010-11-08 18:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6216902, 917871, 59796, '<td valign="top">Somehow this reminds me of the corridors from the movie "Shining". Very eerie and mysterious :) Nicely executed. My top 5.</td>', 'Somehow this reminds me of the corridors from the movie "Shining". Very eerie and mysterious :) Nicely executed. My top 5.', '2010-11-08 18:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6216905, 916843, 59796, '<td valign="top">Aha! I spotted the hidden photographer! :)<br/>So you''ve got not just yourself, but someone else to wake up at that hour. Kudos :)<br/>As for the picture itself, nicely done - although I think the flash tone in the foreground is not gelling well with the rest of the night scene. My top 10 for this challenge.</td>', 'Aha! I spotted the hidden photographer! :)So you''ve got not just yourself, but someone else to wake up at that hour. Kudos :)As for the picture itself, nicely done - although I think the flash tone in the foreground is not gelling well with the rest of the night scene. My top 10 for this challenge.', '2010-11-08 18:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6216906, 916625, 59796, '<td valign="top">Would love to see this in color - although I''m sure you had a good reason to go with B/W. Brrr... must''ve been brutally cold - hope it''s worth your effort and ends up in the top5.</td>', 'Would love to see this in color - although I''m sure you had a good reason to go with B/W. Brrr... must''ve been brutally cold - hope it''s worth your effort and ends up in the top5.', '2010-11-08 18:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
