(6216961, 917889, 108069, '<td valign="top">Certainly has that mood to it. When daybreak is just about to hit. Nice light through the clouds. If I were at the controls I''d try to tweak the color a bit to get more out of the sunrise, and I''d crop that left tree out and move the tree in the center more to the left. Maybe get a bit closer and use it more as the foreground. But I don''t know much.</td>', 'Certainly has that mood to it. When daybreak is just about to hit. Nice light through the clouds. If I were at the controls I''d try to tweak the color a bit to get more out of the sunrise, and I''d crop that left tree out and move the tree in the center more to the left. Maybe get a bit closer and use it more as the foreground. But I don''t know much.', '2010-11-08 18:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
