(6218188, 917815, 117534, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!!!!! I had her picked! Wicked Great Pix... Had me fooled I thought it was a New York City street scene.. LOL   Really made me feel "in the moment"</td>', 'Congratulations!!!!! I had her picked! Wicked Great Pix... Had me fooled I thought it was a New York City street scene.. LOL   Really made me feel "in the moment"', '2010-11-10 00:19:35.000000', NULL, 0),
