(6218232, 916831, 100831, '<td valign="top">I really like the warm and cozy comfyness of this shot. And the light. At 4AM. Blinding usually, but here it works to your advantage. Well done.</td>', 'I really like the warm and cozy comfyness of this shot. And the light. At 4AM. Blinding usually, but here it works to your advantage. Well done.', '2010-11-10 00:31:13.000000', NULL, 0),
