(6218465, 917815, 57229, '<td valign="top">Best of the bunch - and you took me back in time. I think that last point may well be a tribute to your excellent processing. Congratulations.</td>', 'Best of the bunch - and you took me back in time. I think that last point may well be a tribute to your excellent processing. Congratulations.', '2010-11-10 05:42:28.000000', NULL, 0),
